    {
      "voiceId": "jonah-goldberg",
      "voiceName": "Jonah Goldberg",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Failed morning negotiations. Modest Aroo content.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/JonahDispatch/status/2041474108957823415",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T11:12:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jonah-goldberg",
      "voiceName": "Jonah Goldberg",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cGood morning. It\u2019s Tuesday. Zo\u00eb and Thumb guy went out very early this morning. I wanted to sleep in. But then I got to go for a walk when they got back. Now I have to convince him that, even though I didn\u2019t do the full morning mission, I still deserve treats. Also, I love you.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/JonahDispatch/status/2041473840665002327",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T11:11:07+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jonah-goldberg",
      "voiceName": "Jonah Goldberg",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There's been a lot of news the last two months, so it's understandable that the Nancy Guthrie story faded from the headlines. But your heart has to go out to the family. I can't imagine how gut-wrenching it would be for her family to go through that.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/JonahDispatch/status/2041274542576853075",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T21:59:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jonah-goldberg",
      "voiceName": "Jonah Goldberg",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Slumber alfresco",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/JonahDispatch/status/2041238752937300200",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T19:36:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
