      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Good time talking to @DouthatNYT on the Remnant podcasts.apple.com/us/podcas\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/JonahDispatch/status/2041150868150493327",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T13:47:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "jonah-goldberg",
      "voiceName": "Jonah Goldberg",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cGood morning. It\u2019s Monday. I did some important barking on the way back from the park. People like hearing \u2018here comes Pippa!\u2019 And \u2018watch out for bears!\u2019 As we drive by. Also, I love you.\u201d",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/JonahDispatch/status/2041118630939615568",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T11:39:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
